cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite this repository and identify the exact commit or release used."
type: software
title: "LeechTrees: Lean-formalized structural results for classical positive-integral Leech trees"
authors:
  - name: "LeechTrees formalization contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/chesshippo/LeechTrees"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4.24 formalization of 66 scoped structural theorem families for
  classical positive-integral Leech trees, with 324 claim-bearing endpoints,
  human-readable proofs, an aggregate axiom audit, and validation evidence.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - Mathlib
  - graph theory
  - weighted trees
  - distinct distances
